ned}\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}\\cdot ((-12)^{2}+(-14)^{2}+(-7)^{2}+{11}^{2}+(-15)^{2}+{5}^{2}+{0}^{2}+(-8)^{2}+(-14)^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}\\cdot (144+196+49+121+225+25+0+64+196) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}\\cdot 1020 \\\\  & =\\frac{1020}{9} \\\\  & =\\frac{340}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the variance is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sigma }^{2} & =\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}}-(\\overset{―}{x})^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{340}{3}-{(-6)}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{340}{3}-36 \\\\  & =\\frac{340-108}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{232}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-263435/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d0040fc1-2134-5eaa-a3e8-6c7a457f75f5"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-263435"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-87608/selection/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" :answer/id #uuid "bcac49a7-5980-5e58-8f59-09ba13427453" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87608/selection/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce" :answer/id #uuid "caa70d3e-9100-5d90-ae5d-9a9ed196158c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87608/selection/e326a281f601aec64d5dcce4921033c5f93cbf7f8b0a7a5809a9962dfadde666" :answer/id #uuid "55d349d8-c6d6-5291-820b-d002c7b0ca45" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87608/selection/33ad5bb85ef2860b8848dac07e73b48f485bff167e79bb938240370691781b46" :answer/id #uuid "aef423aa-d4cf-5185-8131-da00d9c76644" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "34" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87608/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "5d2768e6-883d-58ae-b92f-4e98ae66afc4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure