ts in our data set, so the mean is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{x} & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot (-5-1+0-8+7+0+9+6) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot 8 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's compute $\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}}.$ Computing the mean of the squares of the points in the data set, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot [(-5)^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{0}^{2}+(-8)^{2}+{7}^{2}+{0}^{2}+{9}^{2}+{6}^{2}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot [25+1+0+64+49+0+81+36] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot 256 \\\\  & =32.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the variance is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sigma }^{2} & =\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}}-(\\overset{―}{x})^{2} \\\\  & =32-{(1)}^{2} \\\\  & =32-1 \\\\  & =31.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-87610/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d0040fc1-2134-5eaa-a3e8-6c7a457f75f5"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-87610"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-87612/selection/6d5046e573d7fdde7d8d1bb855eb7bae7f462620184e71dfefe3b68b295e5d3f" :answer/id #uuid "6aebbcec-030f-5b67-8f5a-864f4202ace2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{\\frac{34}{7}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87612/selection/4100ed1790f32fb69d902f57f9220478e94b5079cc5474c2bf02180ab111f3ce" :answer/id #uuid "c6403f13-3c56-5747-9edb-51158f6aee65" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{\\frac{97}{7}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87612/selection/e548286a5104be629d1cc196238b2ba361eaeb67dfae27cc59971208755e4f8f" :answer/id #uuid "7a309274-d688-5812-918b-e31de7d35d65" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{\\frac{31}{7}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87612/selection/97070f0af00ce93a167462975c09606a6c1e3e9d92ba67bb6c4119a17a64114c" :answer/id #uuid "40d53c4e-80b3-5f93-b1fe-44be00b87971" :a