uting the mean of the squares of the points in the data set, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}\\cdot ({7}^{2}+{3}^{2}+{3}^{2}+{5}^{2}+{1}^{2}+{0}^{2}+{2}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}\\cdot (49+9+9+25+1+0+4) \\\\  & =\\frac{97}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the variance is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sigma }^{2} & =\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}}-(\\overset{―}{x})^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{97}{7}-{(3)}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{97}{7}-9 \\\\  & =\\frac{97-63}{7} \\\\  & =\\frac{34}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the standard deviation is\n\n$$\n\\sigma =\\sqrt{{\\sigma }^{2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{34}{7}}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-87612/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5a72dae6-2bbf-5e59-b71d-8ee57f589753"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-87612"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-246726"] :question/worked-solution "The standard deviation of a data set ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}$ is the square root of the variance:\n\n$$\n\\sigma =\\sqrt{{\\sigma }^{2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\\overset{―}{x})^{2}}=\\sqrt{\\,\\,\\,\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}}-{(\\overset{―}{x})}^{2}}\n$$\n\nFirst, let's compute $\\overset{―}{x}.$ There are $n=5$ points in our data set, so the mean is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{x} & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot (-9-7+1+3+4) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot (-8) \\\\  & =-\\frac{8}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's compute $\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}}.$ Computing the mean of the squares of the points in the data set, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot [(-9)^{2}+(-7)^{2}+{1}^{2}+{3}^{2}+{4}^{2}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot [81+49+1+9+16] \\\\  & =\\frac{156}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the variance is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sigma }^{2} & =\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}}-(\\overset{―}{x})^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{156}{5}-{(-\\frac{8}{5})}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{156}{5}-\\frac{64}{25} \\\\  & =\\frac{780-64}{25} \\\\  & =\\frac{716}{25}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the standard deviation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sigma  & =\\sqrt{{\\sigma }^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{716}{25}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{179}}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-87613/selection/175cc02d518d6ae7137645a66a5af174c3a5a5908ed8d4d38b840f061c47ccd5" :answer/id #uuid "9354f757-9558-5710-be71-54b54fede24b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{\\frac{41}{5}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87613/selection/e00d4293cde85602647b690d2c1c34660ccedf4faaeb8fa7d0bfa8fc49c7ff6c" :answer/id #uuid "8eef4b8e-0904-5b62-9d7e-34edbd0c11ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{\\frac{48}{5}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87613/selection/3b4962f9223546af8719e843f81f22e89e5c0ed147a38075919520b4c18f4c24" :answer/id #uuid "eb0e4148-90fe-5940-9fab-2efc98c6a815" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{\\frac{37}{5}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87613/selection/424e3adfc49d5849b28caa767a14e9a3b17605371b95e75fa591137a19617cd4" :answer/id #uuid "99b5b8b3-6fb0-5bab-9c5a-69e68b850b43" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{\\frac{124}{5}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87613/selection/eb0e73aecfd4bbff6af59238806eb57aa594f2d6726c6a14c1641fc293e1a42c" :answer/id #uuid "978bef72-41a7-5b7d-9707-11ed6d01c37b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{\\frac{44}{5}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-87613/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "33269fb3-5f15-50bd-8e63-58556d492883" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-87613/selection/eb0e73aecfd4bbff6af59238806eb57aa594f2d6726c6a14c1641fc29